# Workshop Studio (Case_A) packaging — local only, not for public GitHub.
# These scripts and artefacts contain Workshop-Studio-specific references
# (Assets_Bucket prefix, workshop catalog ID) and are tracked in the internal
# workshop-docs repo. The public Case_B GitHub repo ships only the scripts
# relevant to developers running ./deploy-all.sh on their own AWS account.
